@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title GOV-1 / REL / INV — C4 System Context

actor "Investigator / Reviewer" as Investigator
actor "Operator / Counsel / Analyst" as Operator

rectangle "ITIR Suite\nInvestigative & relational product" as ITIR <<System>>
rectangle "SensibLaw\nCanonical semantic + governance evaluator" as SL <<System>>
rectangle "StatiBaker\nExecution-memory / operational evidence" as SB <<System>>
rectangle "DASHI (Agda / Lean)\nFormal proof owners" as DASHI <<System>>
rectangle "Dioxus / Svelte\nHuman workbench projections" as UI <<System>>

cloud "External source systems\nWikidata · Wikipedia · legal · biomedical · public records" as Sources
cloud "Optional external services\nregistries · authorized providers · source locators" as Providers

Investigator --> UI : inspect residuals, routes, evidence\nreview / request bounded actions
Operator --> UI : matter-scoped review
UI --> ITIR : typed read/action requests\n(no semantic authority)
ITIR --> SL : source/PNF/review/governance contracts
SL --> ITIR : comparisons, residuals, control assessments
SB --> SL : execution / service / observer receipts
SL --> SB : bounded normalized handoff refs
SL --> DASHI : theorem surface / runtime witness boundary
DASHI --> SL : formal refinement receipts\n(no automatic runtime→proof coercion)
Sources --> SL : revision-pinned canonical source material
Providers --> SL : candidate evidence / acquisition results\nsubject to access + ingestion boundaries

note right of ITIR
  Product loop:
  REL residual
  -> acquisition obligation
  -> non-scalar Pareto frontier
  -> lawful new source
  -> selective reopening
  -> Compare_q
end note

note bottom of UI
  Projection only:
  selected != preferred
  hidden != absent
  blocked != dominated
  executable != authorized truth
end note
@enduml
